{"id": "ledgar/test/5135", "source": "ledgar", "primitive": "choice", "split": "test", "state": "\"The Company agrees to defend, hold harmless, and indemnify Executive for any and all claims arising from and/or in any way related to Executive’s employment with the Company, including but not limited to reasonable attorney’s fees, costs and damages and other related litigation expenses, for any and all claims arising out of any lawsuits, charges of discrimination, or wage claims (the “ Cases ”). To the extent Executive was a covered insured by any Company insurance policy, nothing herein negates such coverage or indemnity provided by such policy except Executive’s refusal to cooperate. The Company’s duty to defend, indemnify, and hold Executive harmless shall not apply if Executive fails to cooperate in the investigation or defense of the Cases or any other proceedings in which Executive has been identified as a material witness. To the extent that it is necessary for Executive to retain counsel other than the Company's counsel with respect to any matter, counsel shall be selected and paid by the Company subject to approval by Executive, which approval shall not be withheld unreasonably.\"", "question": "{\"type\": \"choice\", \"instructions\": \"Which contract provision category does this clause belong to?\", \"criteria\": {\"Adjustments\": null, \"Agreements\": null, \"Amendments\": null, \"Anti-Corruption Laws\": null, \"Applicable Laws\": null, \"Approvals\": null, \"Arbitration\": null, \"Assignments\": null, \"Assigns\": null, \"Authority\": null, \"Authorizations\": null, \"Base Salary\": null, \"Benefits\": null, \"Binding Effects\": null, \"Books\": null, \"Brokers\": null, \"Capitalization\": null, \"Change In Control\": null, \"Closings\": null, \"Compliance With Laws\": null, \"Confidentiality\": null, \"Consent To Jurisdiction\": null, \"Consents\": null, \"Construction\": null, \"Cooperation\": null, \"Costs\": null, \"Counterparts\": null, \"Death\": nu